# Design system (code-first)

**Source of truth:** `packages/tokens`, `packages/react`, and `docs/`.

## Architecture

| Layer | Role | Location |
|-------|------|----------|
| **Primitive / Foundation** | Raw palette, spacing, radius, typography, motion, foundation sizes | `packages/tokens/src/global/*.ts` |
| **Semantic** | Meaningful aliases (colors, motion roles, elevation, text roles) | `packages/tokens/src/semantic/*.ts` |
| **Component tokens** | Per-component color / typography / size roles | `packages/react/src/tokens/*` |
| **Components** | Shipped UI | `packages/react/src/components/*` |
| **Docs** | Live previews, API reference, usage | `docs/src/content/docs/` |

## Token package layout (`packages/tokens/src/global/`)

- `colors.ts` — palette primitives
- `fonts.ts`, `typographys.ts` — font families, sizes, weights, line heights, type scale
- `spacings.ts` — sizeNone ~ sizeXXXLarge
- `foundationSizes.ts` — Global/Size steps (aliases for component dimensions)
- `strokeWidths.ts`, `borderRadii.ts`, `shadows.ts`, `motion.ts`, `zIndex.ts`
- `semantic/colors.ts` — `--refineui-color-alias-*` (light/dark)
- `semantic/componentSizes.ts` — component dimension aliases → foundationSizes
- `semantic/interaction.ts` — motion roles (duration, easing, scale)

Build: `bun run build:tokens` → `dist/css-variables.css`, `dist/tailwind-theme.css`.

## Component rules

- **MUST**: Match existing component patterns in `packages/react` — read a sibling component before adding or changing APIs.
- **MUST**: Use design tokens only for color, spacing, radius, stroke, typography, shadow, z-index, motion. See `tokens-in-components`.
- **MUST**: Composable subcomponent APIs only — no convenience props (`title`, `description`, `items`, `actions`, `onClose`).
- **MUST NOT**: Invent variants, props, or dimensions that are not reflected in tokens + an existing component pattern.
- **RECOMMENDED**: Add or update `docs/src/content/docs/components/*.mdx` and catalog previews when shipping components.

## Docs & AI context

- Site: https://refineui.dev
- Foundations: `/foundations/*` (color, typography, spacing, layout, …)
- Components: flat A–Z catalog under `/components/*`
- Iconography: external — https://github.com/pelagornis/refineui-system-icons
- LLM indexes: `docs/public/llm.txt`, `llms.txt`

